  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3>Baseline variants</h3>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<p>The baseline navigation rail is no longer recommended, and should be replaced by the collapsed navigation rail. <a href=\"/m3/pages/navigation-rail/specs#d4d97764-20ec-496f-a6f3-0d423940ec5a\" target=\"_self\">View baseline tokens</a></p>"
  },
  {
